 & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-0.3 \\\\ 0.2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
